    {
        "content": "<p>should <code>synthInstance</code> throw an error when it receives something that's not a type</p>",
        "id": 590583421,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776985685
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>or maybe <code>#synth</code> should throw the error</p>",
        "id": 590583436,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776985695
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>for the outParam?</p>",
        "id": 590583590,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776985800
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>the problem is that you are asking typeclass to find an instance of <code>TupleGet 3 (ℕ × ℕ × Type × ℕ)</code></p>",
        "id": 590583975,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776986022
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>but <code>TupleGet 3 (ℕ × ℕ × Type × ℕ)</code> isn't even a type so it can't have terms</p>",
        "id": 590583994,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1776986035
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>hm I see that makes sense, thank you!</p>",
        "id": 590584084,
        "sender_full_name": "nrs",
        "timestamp": 1776986099
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>given that fact, turning the outparam into an implicit makes it synth</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TupleGet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">selection</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- succeeds</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TupleGet</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">×</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- succeeds</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>thanks again!</p>",
